  "cautions": [
    "The destruction vocabulary and تِبْرٌ meaning unworked metal or ore are separate lexical branches of the root; the metal sense does not apply to the Quranic destruction forms.",
    "The scope of تِبْرٌ varies in Classical usage: it is chiefly associated with native gold, but is also extended to silver, other ores, and, in a distinct attestation, broken glass."
